    "Nothing has changed yet. Untick what you'd rather keep as it is, then tidy up. Everything removed goes to the Trash, and your games, saves and BIOS files aren't touched.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rien n’a encore changé. Décochez ce que vous préférez garder tel quel, puis rangez. Tout ce qui est retiré va à la corbeille, et vos jeux, sauvegardes et fichiers BIOS ne sont pas touchés."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing new for “%@”: it already has everything found. Use Scrape Info › Replace Existing Info to overwrite it.": {
