      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "capture d’écran"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "shadPS4 is still young: many games don't start or run slowly yet. Its Mac version runs through Rosetta.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "shadPS4 est encore jeune : beaucoup de jeux ne démarrent pas ou tournent lentement. Sa version Mac passe par Rosetta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "shadPS4 uses its own controller setup — Attic's controller settings don't apply.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "shadPS4 utilise sa propre configuration de manette — les réglages de manette d’Attic ne s’appliquent pas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "xemu needs the Xbox boot ROM (MCPX), a flash BIOS and a hard disk image. Set them once in xemu (Settings › System).": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "xemu a besoin de la ROM de démarrage Xbox (MCPX), d’un BIOS flash et d’une image de disque dur. Indiquez-les une fois dans xemu (Réglages › Système)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "xemu uses its own controller setup — configure it once in xemu.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "xemu utilise sa propre configuration de manette — réglez-la une fois dans xemu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” has %lld games; %lld aren't in your library.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "“%1$@” has %2$lld games; %3$lld aren't in your library."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "« %1$@ » a %2$lld jeux ; %3$lld ne sont pas dans votre bibliothèque."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” has all %lld of its games.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "“%1$@” has all %2$lld of its games."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "« %1$@ » a ses %2$lld jeux."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⌘-click to add or remove a game, ⇧-click to select a range, ⌘A to select everything shown.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⌘-clic pour ajouter ou retirer un jeu, ⇧-clic pour sélectionner une plage, ⌘A pour tout sélectionner."
          }
        }
      }
    }
